    "prompt": "Add an isWarning(value) export that tells whether a value is a warning item created by createWarning or createDeprecation.",
    "requirement": "process-warning exports isWarning(value) (also on the default and processWarning namespace objects). It returns the boolean true for any function returned by createWarning or createDeprecation, and false for everything else: other functions, plain objects (even ones that copy a warning's name/code/message/emitted properties), null and undefined. It never throws.",
